			"notes": "## Fox Mobile 1.3.20\n\nCalls started from the nearby-player list now require a known number: either it is saved in your contacts or its owner has opted into showing it. If the number is hidden, selecting the row does not open a call and explains that you can add the number to contacts or dial it manually. Inviting someone into an ongoing group call is unchanged.\n\n**Validation:** Gradle build succeeded. Backend/API unchanged from 1.3.19."
