			"notes": "## Fox Mobile 1.3.19\n\n- Player numbers are hidden in the nearby-player directory by default. Each player can opt in to showing their own number.\n- The public directory is scoped to the current Minecraft server; existing database rows migrate with sharing disabled.\n- In an accepted call, an unsaved caller is identified by number rather than their Minecraft nickname. The add/edit contact action is available only after the call connects.\n- Contacts can be given a local label and their saved number can be edited later. No “who is this?” button is added.\n\n**Validation:** 70 backend tests passed; Gradle build succeeded. The backend was deployed to the Oracle Ubuntu host with a SQLite backup and health check."
		},
